            "text": "The regression matrix covers bare/BMP emoji, modifiers, ZWJ, VS15/VS16, mixed text, RTL surroundings, and a line boundary. The targeted text-font-variant-emoji visual fixture remains pixel exact (0 regions, 0.00%).",
            "markdown": "The regression matrix covers bare/BMP emoji, modifiers, ZWJ, VS15/VS16, mixed text, RTL surroundings, and a line boundary. The targeted text-font-variant-emoji visual fixture remains pixel exact (0 regions, 0.00%)."
          },
